From: LYW-30M local development <local@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] ath11k: update basic RSSI without optional RX statistics

The small-memory build does not allocate arsta->rx_stats. Returning before
updating the basic RSSI also leaves the EWMA empty: station dumps then
report the noise floor as signal_avg. Update the two existing scalar
statistics before the optional histogram check; do not allocate RX stats.

--- a/drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath11k/dp_rx.c
+++ b/drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath11k/dp_rx.c
@@ -3550,11 +3550,12 @@
 	u32 num_msdu;
 	int i;
 
+	/* Basic station RSSI must not depend on optional RX histograms. */
+	arsta->rssi_comb = ppdu_info->rssi_comb;
+	ewma_avg_rssi_add(&arsta->avg_rssi, ppdu_info->rssi_comb);
+
 	if (!rx_stats)
 		return;
-
-	arsta->rssi_comb = ppdu_info->rssi_comb;
-	ewma_avg_rssi_add(&arsta->avg_rssi, ppdu_info->rssi_comb);
 
 	if (!ath11k_debugfs_is_extd_rx_stats_enabled(ar))
 		return;
